      </div>\n      </section>\n      <section data-testid=\"recurrence\" className=\"p-card rounded-card bg-surface-raised border border-default shadow-raised flex flex-col gap-medium\">\n        <h2 className=\"text-heading font-bold text-primary\">Recurrence</h2>\n        <div className=\"flex flex-col gap-small\">\n          <p className=\"text-body text-primary\">Repeat every (days)</p>\n          <input type=\"number\" data-testid=\"repeat-every\" defaultValue={7} className=\"h-control px-control rounded-control text-body bg-surface-raised text-primary border border-strong\" />\n          <label htmlFor=\"until\" className=\"text-caption font-medium text-muted\">Until</label>\n          <input id=\"until\" data-testid=\"repeat-until\" defaultValue=\"2027-03-31\" className=\"h-[calc(var(--ng-control-height)*0.8)] px-control rounded-control text-body bg-surface-raised text-primary border border-strong\" />\n          <p data-testid=\"repeat-hint\" className=\"mt-[calc(var(--ng-space-small)/2)] text-caption text-muted\">Leave empty to repeat forever.</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  );\n}\n"
